          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "why": "No executive requests gift cards by email \u2014 urgency plus an unusual request is the signature of this scam. The right move is to stop, not engage, and report it so security can warn others and block the sender. Reporting turns one near-miss into protection for the whole company.",
